{%- comment -%}
  FIUTO — custom design layer.
  Loads the display typeface, the design-system stylesheet and the motion engine.
  Rendered from layout/theme.liquid, after Horizon's own stylesheets so the
  custom layer always wins the cascade without needing !important everywhere.
{%- endcomment -%}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
